// Settings Associative Edit And Mass — Tích hợp lệnh, preview, giao diện
// ROLE: INTEGRATE - wire owners together; do not reimplement their logic.
//
// Purpose: Associative settings & metal mass: tích hợp lệnh, preview, giao diện. đổi gem và kim loại, xem cập nhật setting, report khối lượng và lời cảnh báo
// Boundary: this task may only orchestrate; each step below must already be owned
//           and tested by the module named in the record's external_owner_interfaces.
//
// Order: V(OCCT BRep) in model unit^3; mass g from density; invalid/open solids not priced. finite coordinates, legal units and tolerance inherited from signed G00 fixture, not invented here. OCCT Check/IsValid on every BRep result; expected intentionally-open result must be explicitly typed. No silent detach of gem/setting feature, stable IDs across recompute and persistence. None. E11 exit & metal weights concepts; no independent Chapter 28 heading for associative mass. Nếu L3 chỉ có parent_l2_range: đây là chỉ mục tra cứu bổ sung, không khẳng định manual có heading độc lập.
//
// Integration checklist:
//   1. resolve owners through the parent service contract, not through UI handles
//   2. keep one transaction boundary: either the whole sequence commits or nothing does
//   3. on any step error, roll back what this sequence already changed and report the failing step
//   4. assert identity survives: same stable IDs before and after, no stale scene reference
//
// Contract under test: (see owner contracts)
// Oracle: Command handler routes to the unique feature owner, not a second implementation
// Negative oracle: no density; open BRep; cycle; dirty cache; material mixed across parts
